From: Isaiah <isaiahdw@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dts: rk3576-armsom-sige5: Nerves fixups (mmc aliases, watchdog)

Two board-dts changes the Nerves system needs:

1. Mainline defines no mmc aliases for this board, so mmcblk numbering
   depends on probe order. Pin the eMMC (the system disk) to mmcblk0
   and the microSD to mmcblk1 so fw_env.config, the erlinit mounts,
   and the fwup devpaths are deterministic.

2. The wdt node is status = "disabled" in rk3576.dtsi and nothing
   enables it. Nerves arms the hardware watchdog through Erlang's
   heart (nerves_heart on /dev/watchdog0 with WATCHDOG_NOWAYOUT).

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576-armsom-sige5.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3576-armsom-sige5.dts
@@ -1039,3 +1039,14 @@
 		remote-endpoint = <&hdmi_in_vp0>;
 	};
 };
+
+/ {
+	aliases {
+		mmc0 = &sdhci;
+		mmc1 = &sdmmc;
+	};
+};
+
+&wdt {
+	status = "okay";
+};
